Installation
------------
Run NehrimInstall.sh
It installs Nehrim, Wrye Bash, LOOT, and uses a bsa unpacker to unpack the sound effect bsa to the same folder bsa is in. This fixes the sounds not playing. 
Folder structure -- ******/drive_c/GOG Games/Nehrim at Fate's Edge GoG/Data/sound/fx/(all manner of sound effect folders)

